    {
      "q": "Are your grains organic and lab-tested?",
      "a": "All products are all-natural, and every batch is lab-tested for purity before it clears import. Items certified organic carry an Organic badge on their product page."
    },
    {
      "q": "What is your return policy?",
      "a": "If anything arrives damaged or you’re not satisfied, contact us within 30 days for a replacement or full refund — no need to ship the product back."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer wholesale or bulk pricing?",
      "a": "Yes. We supply restaurants, grocers and distributors with volume pricing from a 50 lb minimum. Submit the wholesale form and an account manager replies within one business day."
    },
    {
      "q": "How should I store rice and grains?",
      "a": "Keep them in a cool, dry place in an airtight container. Stored properly, our aged rice keeps for 12–18 months and only improves with rest."
    }
